00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:58.920
Thank you! I'll have to give my pet his treat!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:02.340
All right! She's finally going to command me to do something wild!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:09.350
Look, Takanashi-kun. I'm wearing the black pantyhose you like.

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:15.610
However, Takanashi-kun, since I have my yukata on, I'm not wearing anything underneath it!

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:20.390
Now, agonise over what you can <i>almost</i>  see!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.860
Yukata banzai!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:31.870
A kiss? Or a glimpse... A glimpse of what's under her yukata?

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.210
Good boy. You did a good job.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:40.300
Takanashi-kun, your yukata is all messed up!

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.090
You're right. It's a mess.

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:45.260
I must look dumb, huh?

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.560
No!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.200
I'll fix it for you!

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:54.060
Oh, there's a bench! It'll be easier to fix it there!

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:59.520
Oh, no! It might be easier if you take it off first!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.330
This is your fault, you know.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.530
Stop!

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:11.870
All because of what you're wearing.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:15.870
This here was the real thing.

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:19.440
Takanashi-kun, are you truly the ideal man?

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.960
Uh, wait...

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:24.220
I'm sorry I can't fix it properly.

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:25.680
Oh! Ah!

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.680
Onii-chan, it looks like you found a new gift!

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.710
Good job, Onii-chan!

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.390
Ah, not there!

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.580
Big brother's turn-ons observation diary.

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:15.450
My big brother finally developed a fetish for yukatas.

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.710
Or more accurately, women who wear nothing under their yukatas.

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:22.880
I successfully watched the fireworks together with my big brother.

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:28.970
Since he carried me home, I let him touch my butt three times without saying anything.
